{"id": "mmqa:1bf7604eb61f9ffc258904ccd06d0b7c", "question": "In 2009 Rally Scotland, when Kris Meeke was the rally leader and 2 (20 Nov) was the day, what was the state in special stages?", "evidence_ids": ["mmqa:table:40b7d2d21854b32e6e941db1db98b488", "mmqa:text:728d9ac739b4d2b3d8b8d4f2ae97e712", "mmqa:text:b3716e5fc3ce9d80b052debb96c357e6", "mmqa:text:313a99a1b4055b25dd64340a06ac7de0", "mmqa:text:6a2df42a57fb1a4d20048883f6ab4f3c"], "answer_label": "", "result": {"answer": "In 2009 Rally Scotland, the special stages occurred on November 19th, 20th, and 21st. On the 20th, Stage 3 was on Craigvinean 1, Stage 4 was on Blackcraig, and Stage 5 was on Errochy. On the 21st, Stages 8 through 13 were held on Achray 1, Fairy Knowe 1, Loch Ard 1, Achray 2, Fairy Knowe 2, and Loch Ard 2, respectively.", "answer_items": ["Special stages on November 19th included SS1 and SS2 at Scone Palace (SS1 at 20:11, SS2 at 20:26). On November 20th, there were stages SS3 at Craigvinean 1 (08:50), SS4 at Blackcraig (10:03), and SS5 at Errochy (12:12). On November 21st, there were stages SS8 at Achray 1 (08:00), SS9 at Fairy Knowe 1 (08:34), SS10 at Loch Ard 1 (09:10), SS11 at Achray 2 (12:56), SS12 at Fairy Knowe 2 (13:30), and SS13 at Loch Ard 2 (14:06)."], "citations": ["mmqa:table:40b7d2d21854b32e6e941db1db98b488", "mmqa:text:6a2df42a57fb1a4d20048883f6ab4f3c"], "abstained": false, "answer_label": "", "provider": "local", "model": "google/gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-q4_0-gguf", "model_version": "675cff42a74c774d6cb76f76d8eacb49b48c9b93", "runtime_version": "b11429", "runtime_manifest_sha256": "1e8f2720b840e73f9a3e2194ba759262fcc01aaab863ea8ee82c1f44aabec488", "media_protocol": {"version": 1, "audio": "native wav/mp3/flac, unchanged bytes", "max_audio_seconds_per_request": 30, "max_video_seconds_per_request": 60, "video": "silent source; timestamped JPEG frames sampled at 0,1,... seconds", "video_fps": 1, "video_frame_long_edge": 768, "jpeg_quality": 3, "max_images_and_frames": 64}, "usage": {"comp